# Projects

Everything I ship in public, in one place. Active repos live on [Codeberg](https://codeberg.org/zanderlewis) first; some may be mirrored on [GitHub](https://github.com/zanderlewis).

## Active

::: project { name="ECRL" codeberg="zanderlewis/ecrl" github="zanderlewis/ecrl" status="active" }
The **Enka-Candler Robotics Language** — a [+crystal] DSL for programming FTC robots. Canonical repo on Codeberg.
:::

::: project { name="Capsule / CML" codeberg="zanderlewis/website" github="zanderlewis/zanderlewis.dev" status="beta" }
This portfolio's engine. Parses `.cml` files into HTML with code capsules, project cards, timelines, and admonitions — no Node.js pipeline.
:::

## Infrequent Updates

::: project { name="Wasteland" github="zanderlewis/wasteland" url="https://zanderlewis.github.io/wasteland/" status="active" }
